    "summary": "Installed daemon (1f1c2ebf), smoke-t5.md: on the registered 3774-file clone of insors-extraction, a comment-only save gave a pass in mode unchanged, filesRead 1, 47 ms (no regroup); a save adding a cross-file call gave mode incremental, filesRead 1, 248 ms, 94 -> 93 groups regrouped in memory; the first pass per repository after the restart was full, as designed. Before/after, cost-t5.md: the old pass (worktree at 1a000fe9d) on the same repository read every entity and edge on every save (530 ms after a comment-only save, 518 ms after a cross-file save) against 13-25 ms and 67 ms for the new pass in the same harness. The before numbers could not be taken on the installed daemon: its summary lane held 156-399 document-summary jobs ahead of the clone's first pass, and once updated it no longer runs the old pass; this deviation is recorded in cost-t5.md. Full sweep, full-sweep-t5.md: all 38 failed cases listed one by one, each with whether it failed in an earlier sweep and its classification; the two this Story caused are fixed (e2ecc4b9f, c53f2db0e); this Story's four subsystem files are now classified in the session-source inventory (084630837).",
